<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 23.39 pct, 3-mo 23.30 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 23.39 pct, 3-mo 23.30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) dropped by 0.01 percentage point for the one-month maturity and by 0.03 percentage points for three months, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The BUBOR was fixed by the NBH at 23.39 percent for the one month and 23.30 for the three month maturity.</p>
<p>The NBH began calculating BUBOR on August 1.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 266 2410</p>
